{"id":"0cdc5739d04bdede","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-hermitian.md","title":"Hermitian","display":"df-hermitian — Hermitian","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hermitian","aliases":["58-df-hermitian"],"display":"df-hermitian — Hermitian","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hermitian"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hermitian</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hermitian — Hermitian"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V,+,\\cdot)\">\\((V,+,\\cdot)\\)</span> (complex vector space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(V,+,\\cdot)\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(V,+,\\cdot)\\)</span> (complex-vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb C^{V\\times V}\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb C^{V\\times V}\\)</span> (form candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in V\">\\(x,y,z\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span> (vectors and scalar)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hermitian}_S(h,V)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hermitian}_S(h,V)\\)</span> (Hermitian-form predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hermitian} \\vdash \\mathrm{Hermitian}_S(h,V) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(V,+,\\cdot)\\land h\\in\\mathbb C^{V\\times V}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in V\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(h(\\alpha\\cdot x+y,z)=\\alpha h(x,z)+h(y,z)\\land h(x,\\alpha\\cdot y+z)=\\overline\\alpha h(x,y)+h(x,z)\\land h(x,y)=\\overline{h(y,x)}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hermitian} \\vdash \\mathrm{Hermitian}_S(h,V) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(V,+,\\cdot)\\land h\\in\\mathbb C^{V\\times V}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in V\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(h(\\alpha\\cdot x+y,z)=\\alpha h(x,z)+h(y,z)\\land h(x,\\alpha\\cdot y+z)=\\overline\\alpha h(x,y)+h(x,z)\\land h(x,y)=\\overline{h(y,x)}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hermitian forms are conjugate-symmetric sesquilinear forms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(V,+,\\cdot)$ (complex vector space, see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(V,+,\\cdot)$ (complex-vector-space predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(V,+,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(V,+,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathbb C^{V\\times V}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hermitian}_S(h,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hermitian} \\vdash \\mathrm{Hermitian}_S(h,V) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(V,+,\\cdot)\\land h\\in\\mathbb C^{V\\times V}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in V\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(h(\\alpha\\cdot x+y,z)=\\alpha h(x,z)+h(y,z)\\land h(x,\\alpha\\cdot y+z)=\\overline\\alpha h(x,y)+h(x,z)\\land h(x,y)=\\overline{h(y,x)}\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1129,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-617","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-hermitian.md|58-df-hermitian]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2","36d7463d215be751"]}